{"availability":"available","full":"dashindev/dashin","name":"dashin","description":"AI-assisted React admin dashboard & panel — a Vite + Tailwind, plugin-based scaffold that generates schema-validated CRUD UIs for PocketBase, Supabase, Appwrite, Directus, Strapi & GraphQL. Live demo: demo.dashin.dev","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2020-02-11T15:37:22Z","updated":"2026-10-08T01:43:12Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://dashin.dev","topics":["admin","admin-dashboard","admin-panel","admin-ui","ai","crud","crud-generator","dashboard","developer-tools","frontend-framework","graphql","headless","internal-tools","low-code","open-source","react","react-admin","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://demo.dashin.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.755Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.755Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.755Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.755Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["▶ Try the live demo — demo.dashin.dev — a full e-commerce admin (dashboard + charts, products, orders, customers) running 100% free on Cloudflare D1. Log in with admin / dashin; it's fully editable and resets every 30 minutes.","Dashin is an open-source, plugin-based React admin dashboard scaffold built on Vite + Tailwind CSS + Headless UI. Point it at your backend — Atomo (Rust Event Sourcing & CQRS), PocketBase, Payload CMS, Supabase, Appwrite, Directus, Turso, Strapi, or GraphQL/REST — and Dashin gives you a schema-validated CRUD admin panel: tables, forms, filtering/sorting, auth, and i18n, ready to ship. It also supports AI generation whose output is validated against your real schema, so even cheap models produce a working admin — never freeform code. Routes, menus, CRUD pages, and auth are all plugins, and…","Dashin hopes to achieve as many function reuse as possible through simple development methods, so in each Dashin project, common functions have been built, such as dynamic routing, multi-level menus, permission control, data management, search filtering and sorting, CRUD, file management, message notification, documenting your code, etc. You only need to build your own plugin to call it, and the Dashin plugin is also easy to learn and use."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dashindev/dashin/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"d9d5a9d4bb87c3559c994bb360a48671034953dc114545f52e22d468959fbc8c","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.960Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.960Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"▶ Try the live demo — demo.dashin.dev — a full e-commerce admin (dashboard + charts, products, orders, customers) running 100% free on Cloudflare D1. Log in with admin / dashin; it's fully editable and resets every 30 minutes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dashindev/dashin/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"> ▶ Try the live demo — demo.dashin.dev — a full e-commerce > admin (dashboard + charts, products, orders, customers) running 100% free on Cloudflare D1. > Log in with admin / dashin; it's fully editable and resets every 30 minutes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dashindev/dashin/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d9d5a9d4bb87c3559c994bb360a48671034953dc114545f52e22d468959fbc8c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dashindev/dashin/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.960Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T01:43:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dashindev/dashin/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:21.961Z","hash":"d9d5a9d4bb87c3559c994bb360a48671034953dc114545f52e22d468959fbc8c","originalBytes":5864,"storedBytes":5864,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["dashin","yarn","admin","build","dashin-dev","tsc","docs","packages","plugin"